.DS_Store

# Real IFC test fixtures (CASA-ARQ.ifc, CASA-MEP.ifc, EOFF-*.ifc) - kept
# out of git deliberately. Combined they are ~450MB of binary data with
# no Git LFS configured in this repo; committing them would permanently
# bloat clone size for everyone. They stay on disk locally and are
# referenced by ../../oguc-core/fixtures/*.ifc from
# packages/ifc-headless's tests, but are not tracked here. If these need
# to be reproducible for a fresh clone or CI, that needs an explicit
# fixture-distribution decision (Git LFS, a download step, or similar) -
# not a decision this gitignore makes on its own.
fixtures/
